   "type": "line",
   "text": "Pushes $68FF as the loader return address, selects two blocks of driving file one and jumps to $0433."
  },
  {
   "address": 12488,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Stages and decompresses a picture, then builds a multicolour bitmap using screen RAM under $DC00 and bitmap RAM at $E000."
  },
  {
   "address": 12607,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Little-endian source addresses for the 4 packed picture programs. The selector indexes with twice the scene number and copies the selected source beginning at $0812."
  },
  {
   "address": 12617,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Reads a source pointer from the picture table and stages 23 pages at $0812 before the decompressor runs at $0813."
  },
  {
   "address": 12976,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Programs each of eight sprite slots from its three parallel arrays for the selected frame. Tests Y=$FF to leave a slot disabled and reads the shape flags after 63 bytes of pixels."
